      "type": "highlights",
      "title": "Product Highlights",
      "bullets": [
        "Game changing 2-component OBN for high quality shallow water seismic acquisition down to 500m;",
        "All-in-one design supports either node-on-a-rope (NOAR) or remotely-operated vehicle (ROV);",
        "Built-in 14Hz omnidirectional high sensitivity geophone;",
        "Optional 3Hz active force feedback geophone for broadband seismic survey;",
        "Built-in standard 3.4Hz hydrophone;",
        "24-bit Δ-Σ ADC converter for high resolution, high dynamic range seismic signal recording;",
        "Configurable sample rate and preamplifier gain;",
        "Built-in test signal generator supports full signal chain function and performance self-inspection;",
        "Built-in high precision thermostatic crystal (OCXO) for ±2ms timing accuracy;",
        "Compact volume (35L x 21W x 11H cm) and light weight (11kg) for convenient deployment and retrieval."
